      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewCard.tsx",
      "content": "Clearing `pushed.current` loses ownership of the overlay history entry even though `navigate(-1)` leaves that entry available to Forward. Reproduce with Replay → Close → browser Forward → Close: the second Close replaces the overlay URL rather than going back, leaving two Review entries, so the next Back appears to do nothing. Track ownership on the history entry (or preserve it across this round trip) and add a Forward-then-Close/Escape test.",
      "existing_code": "      pushed.current = false;\n      void navigate(-1);",
